==German==
===Etymology===
From {{etym|goh|de}} {{term|stuba|lang=goh}}. More at {{term|stove|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃtuːbə/|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Stuben|Stübchen}}

# {{context|regional|lang=de}} [[living room]]
# [[parlour]] {{gloss|a room used chiefly for representation purposes; often called {{term|gute Stube|lang=de}} or the like}}
# the [[heated]] rooms of a traditional [[farmhouse]] (as opposed to stables, kitchen, etc.)
# {{context|military|lang=de}} [[bedroom]] in a [[barracks]]

